«
@@ ============================================================
@@ WPIns — insert a waypoint into the route, for instance to divert.
@@
@@ Input : "name" φ λ n — the new waypoint becomes waypoint n of the
@@         route; the following ones move down by one. A position past
@@         the end adds it at the end.
@@ If the active leg (RouteLeg) comes at or after position n, it is
@@ moved down too, so that it keeps pointing to the same waypoints.
@@ ============================================================

  → pos
  «
    3 →LIST 1 →LIST
    IFERR 'Route' RCL THEN DROP { } END
    → wpl rtl
    «
      IF pos 1 > THEN rtl 1 pos 1 - SUB ELSE { } END
      wpl +
      rtl pos rtl SIZE SUB +
      'Route' STO
      IFERR 'RouteLeg' RCL THEN DROP ELSE
        IF DUP pos ≥ THEN 1 + 'RouteLeg' STO ELSE DROP END
      END
    »
  »
»
